5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I'm not really sure what to say first.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,Let's keep this logical. We need to identify the werewolf quickly. Anyone have any initial thoughts?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Such eagerness, Shion. Let's just see how everyone behaves. I'm sure the wolf will slip up eventually.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's nice to meet you all. Let's try to get along and find the answer together, okay?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,I shall observe for now. It is best to listen to everyone's tone before jumping to conclusions.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@George, you're being very passive. Are you hiding something, or just playing the elder role?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Leave the old man alone. He's just being cautious, which is a trait some of us could learn.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"Now, now, let's not start arguing already. We should be supportive of one another.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,"I am simply taking my time, Shion. Experience has taught me that haste often leads to errors.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Midori-san. We shouldn't fight.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Harmony is fine, but it doesn't find the werewolf. I'm looking for inconsistencies.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"You're trying too hard to lead, Shion. It's almost predictable.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I think it's wonderful that Shion is so motivated, but let's keep the atmosphere friendly.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
