31,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Good morning... I hope everyone is okay.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's get to the point. If the Seer found something, now is the time to consider how to use that information.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Or the Seer is the werewolf lying about their results. It's a classic play, isn't it?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"That's a bit scary to think about, but I suppose we have to be careful.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,George,,"I have seen enough. Shunichi, your confidence is a mask for something far more sinister.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,@George-san? Do you... do you mean Shunichi-san is the werewolf?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shion,,Interesting. George is making a direct accusation. Either he's the Seer or he's a very bold werewolf.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, coming for me already? How quaint. You're either desperate or very bad at this game.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Oh dear, this is getting intense. Are you sure, George-san?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,George,,I am certain. I have seen the truth of his nature. He is the werewolf.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I want to believe George-san. He seems so reliable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shion,,"If George is the Seer, the game ends now. If he's the wolf, he's trying to frame Shunichi. I'll trust the Seer's claim for now.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"You're all so gullible. A simple claim of ""truth"" and you fold? How boring.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,I trust George-san too. He's always been so calm and fair.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,George,,"I do not seek to lead, but I will not let a predator remain among us.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote for Shunichi-san... I think.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shion,,The logic holds. George's timing is too precise to be a random guess. I'm voting Shunichi.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Fine. Enjoy your victory if you're right, but you'll regret it if you're wrong.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I'm sorry, Shunichi-san, but I have to go with George-san.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
